From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Desidero <desidero@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 23 Oct 2026 14:29:36 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(web): emphasize the items the latest reply mentions

With several labelled items open, the Open items panel gave no hint which
ones the agent's newest reply was about, so the user had to read the whole
reply to find out. The index now records each item's newest mention and the
latest agent reply; the panel lists the items that reply mentions first,
tinted like the other amber marks, and includes an item the reply just
closed, struck through, so what was resolved is visible too. Expanded, they
sit under an "In the latest reply" heading ahead of the other open items and
the Closed fold, and the chips' accessible names say so.

Part of the local chat-item-labels series (item label chips, the Open items
panel and item comments), which is local-only.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Signed-off-by: Desidero <desidero@gmail.com>
